+    "note": "86 real scalar reduced dimensions; exact link stiffnesses; persistent nongauge Jordan growth around the nonzero neutral flat family; separate nonlinear vacuum stability proof. 50 exact constructor checks. Higher-rank residual stabilizer retained. Physical promotion 0.",
